    "model_design": "Change #2: Model Architecture. Add uncertainty-weighted multi-task learning: each task head outputs mean and log variance; loss becomes negative log-likelihood (Gaussian) to dynamically weight tasks. Also add a small Transformer encoder layer after shared features for cross-task attention. Replace MaskedHuberLoss with uncertainty-weighted NLL loss. Modify model forward to output means and log_vars; modify loss function to compute NLL with masking.",
